{
  "type": "Collection",
  "id": "spatial-features/gbr-quadgrid15",
  "stac_version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "CARTO Spatial Features v4 for the United Kingdom on Quadgrid level 15 cells (~1 km, quadbin index). Every cell carries population and the full age/sex structure (WorldPop), points-of-interest counts by category (Overture Maps), elevation (NASA ASTER GDEM), an urbanity classification, monthly climate normals — temperature, precipitation, solar radiation, wind and vapour pressure (WorldClim) — nighttime lights (VIIRS), cell-tower density (OpenCellID) and CARTO's Human Activity Index. Mirror of the CARTO Data Observatory dataset `derived_spatialfeatures_gbr_quadgrid15_v1_yearly_v4` (do_date 2026-01-01, 494,893 cells), republished as GeoParquet with the cell polygons from `geography_gbr_quadgrid15_v1`.",
